MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05

      Title: Chicken Pot Pie
 Categories: Poultry, Main dish
      Yield: 6 Servings

      1 lb Chicken breast, cubed
      1 c  Peas
      2 ea Carrots, diced

MMMMM-----------------------FOR THE SAUCE----------------------------
      2 T  Butter
      3 T  Flour
      1 t  Salt
        pn Pepper
      2 c  Chicken stock

MMMMM-------------------------TOPPING--------------------------------
      1    Pie crust

  Simmer the chicken, peas and carrots until tender.
  Melt the butter, stir in the flour and whisk in the stock.
  Pour into a dish, cover with the crust and bake for 30 minutes.

MMMMM

MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05

      Title: Lemonade
 Categories: Drinks
      Yield: 4 Servings

      4 ea Lemons                          1 c  Sugar
      4 c  Water                           1 ds Salt

  Squeeze the lemons and stir everything together.

